The Kitchen is a room. "A small kitchen. A door leads south."
The Diner is south of the Kitchen.
A cake is in the Kitchen. The cake is edible.

Instead of eating the cake when the player is in the Kitchen:
	say "Not here. Cake is for the Diner."

After going to the Diner:
	say "The Diner smells of coffee.";
	continue the action.
